<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="0频率的暗号"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Voiceless password"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="周波数0の合言葉"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KAF"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kaf"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="かふ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花譜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花谱"/><amll:meta key="album" value="0频率的暗号"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Transcendent Love"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Voiceless password - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="周波数0の合言葉"/><amll:meta key="album" value="周波数0の合言葉 - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深爱"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602600569"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3348592774"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383671953"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0003Phbc13o6E0"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000656iL4Sr0vA"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="641331136"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="667146781"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="58TuKQD2zM3mSFPChhpNGY"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="6y7jCiewLSIwl2sqmkJFvF"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1872604651"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764277993"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:17.720"><div begin="39.520" end="4:17.720"><p begin="39.520" end="44.270" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.520" end="40.040">大</span><span begin="40.150" end="40.750">切</span><span begin="40.750" end="41.170">な</span><span begin="42.060" end="42.250">こ</span><span begin="42.250" end="42.430">と</span><span begin="42.430" end="42.650">か</span><span begin="42.650" end="43.030">ら</span><span begin="43.030" end="43.630">忘</span><span begin="43.630" end="43.770">れ</span><span begin="43.890" end="44.270">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是先把最重要的事情遗忘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">總是先把最重要的事情遺忘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I forgot the things that mattered most first</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 것부터 잊어 가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai commencé par oublier ce qui comptait le plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Fui olvidando primero las cosas importantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich vergaß zuerst die wichtigen Dinge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Comecei esquecendo justamente as coisas importantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Первым делом я забывала самое важное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimenticando per prime le cose più importanti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu na koto kara wasurete</span></p><p begin="44.950" end="49.590" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.950" end="45.360">気</span><span begin="45.360" end="45.610">付</span><span begin="45.610" end="46.060">い</span><span begin="46.150" end="46.580">た</span><span begin="46.580" end="46.920">ら</span><span begin="47.300" end="47.920">空</span><span begin="47.920" end="48.110">っ</span><span begin="48.110" end="48.470">ぽ</span><span begin="48.470" end="48.880">だ</span><span begin="48.880" end="49.290">っ</span><span begin="49.290" end="49.590">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回过神时 心里已经空无一物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">回過神時 心裡已經空無一物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When I noticed I was empty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨닫고 보니 텅 비어 있었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand je m’en suis rendu compte j’étais vide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando me di cuenta estaba vacía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als ich es bemerkte war ich ganz leer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando percebi já estava vazia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда заметила я уже была пуста</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando me ne sono accorta ero vuota</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuitara karappo datta</span></p><p begin="51.170" end="57.250" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.170" end="51.260">お</span><span begin="51.380" end="51.770">しゃ</span><span begin="51.770" end="51.920">れ</span><span begin="52.010" end="52.310">な</span><span begin="52.400" end="52.790">花</span><span begin="52.790" end="53.210">瓶</span><span begin="53.210" end="53.570">に</span><span begin="54.550" end="54.880">何</span><span begin="54.880" end="55.000">を</span><span begin="55.120" end="55.880">飾</span><span begin="55.880" end="56.270">り</span><span begin="56.270" end="56.510">ま</span><span begin="56.640" end="57.250">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样漂亮的花瓶里 该摆上些什么才好呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這樣漂亮的花瓶裡 該擺上些什麼才好呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What should I place in this elegant vase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세련된 꽃병에는 무엇을 장식할까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que pourrais-je mettre dans ce joli vase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué pondré en este elegante jarrón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Was soll ich in die schöne Vase stellen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O que vamos colocar neste vaso elegante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что же поставить в красивую вазу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un vaso elegante che cosa dovrei mettere in mostra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Oshare na kabin ni nani o kazarimashou</span></p><p begin="58.200" end="1:03.170" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.200" end="58.840">誰</span><span begin="58.840" end="59.100">に</span><span begin="59.200" end="59.440">で</span><span begin="59.440" end="59.780">も</span><span begin="1:00.790" end="1:01.020">愛</span><span begin="1:01.110" end="1:01.350">さ</span><span begin="1:01.350" end="1:01.720">れ</span><span begin="1:01.720" end="1:01.940">る</span><span begin="1:01.940" end="1:02.760">様</span><span begin="1:02.760" end="1:03.170">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了能被所有人喜爱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為了能被所有人喜愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that everyone would love me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누구에게나 사랑받을 수 있도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour être aimée de tout le monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para que todos puedan quererme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit ich von jedem geliebt werde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para que todos possam me amar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы меня любили все</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per essere amata da chiunque</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare ni demo aisareru you ni</span></p><p begin="1:03.660" end="1:08.690" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.660" end="1:03.800">当</span><span begin="1:03.940" end="1:04.470">た</span><span begin="1:04.470" end="1:04.830">り</span><span begin="1:04.830" end="1:05.610">障</span><span begin="1:05.610" end="1:05.740">り</span><span begin="1:05.850" end="1:06.260">ば</span><span begin="1:06.380" end="1:06.770">か</span><span begin="1:06.770" end="1:07.090">り</span><span begin="1:07.180" end="1:07.430">気</span><span begin="1:07.560" end="1:07.810">に</span><span begin="1:07.910" end="1:08.070">し</span><span begin="1:08.210" end="1:08.690">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总顾忌着是否会招人不快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">總顧忌著是否會招人不快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Always worrying only about never offending anyone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모나지 않는 것만 신경 쓰고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne pensais qu’à ne froisser personne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Preocupándome solo por no incomodar a nadie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Achtete ich nur darauf niemandem anzuecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sempre preocupada apenas em não desagradar ninguém</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я думала лишь о том чтобы никого не задеть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Pensando soltanto a non urtare nessuno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Atarisawari bakari ki ni shite</span></p><p begin="1:09.920" end="1:17.310" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.920" end="1:10.330">濁</span><span begin="1:10.330" end="1:10.500">っ</span><span begin="1:10.500" end="1:10.600">た</span><span begin="1:10.690" end="1:11.410">水</span><span begin="1:11.410" end="1:11.760">を</span><span begin="1:11.760" end="1:11.910">捨</span><span begin="1:12.100" end="1:12.800">て</span><span begin="1:13.230" end="1:13.310">何</span><span begin="1:13.400" end="1:13.510">時</span><span begin="1:13.640" end="1:13.780">も</span><span begin="1:13.780" end="1:14.570">笑</span><span begin="1:14.570" end="1:14.870">う</span><span begin="1:14.960" end="1:15.730">花</span><span begin="1:15.730" end="1:16.100">を</span><span begin="1:16.100" end="1:16.260">生</span><span begin="1:16.370" end="1:16.620">け</span><span begin="1:16.770" end="1:17.310">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒掉浑浊的水 插上一朵永远微笑的花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倒掉渾濁的水 插上一朵永遠微笑的花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I threw away the murky water and arranged flowers that always smiled</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">탁해진 물을 버리고 언제나 웃는 꽃을 꽂았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai jeté l’eau trouble et placé une fleur qui sourit toujours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tiré el agua turbia y puse una flor que siempre sonríe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich schüttete das trübe Wasser weg und stellte Blumen hinein die immer lächeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Joguei fora a água turva e coloquei uma flor que sempre sorri</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вылив мутную воду я поставила цветок который всегда улыбается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho gettato l&apos;acqua torbida e vi ho messo un fiore che sorride sempre</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nigotta mizu o sute itsumo warau hana o iketa</span></p><p begin="1:19.280" end="1:24.980" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.280" end="1:19.520">あ</span><span begin="1:19.520" end="1:19.760">り</span><span begin="1:19.900" end="1:20.260">の</span><span begin="1:20.260" end="1:20.360">ま</span><span begin="1:20.450" end="1:20.660">ま</span><span begin="1:20.660" end="1:20.810">で</span><span begin="1:20.810" end="1:20.930">居</span><span begin="1:21.020" end="1:21.220">て</span><span begin="1:21.220" end="1:21.400">く</span><span begin="1:21.400" end="1:21.580">れ</span><span begin="1:21.580" end="1:21.800">る</span><span begin="1:21.800" end="1:22.180">君</span><span begin="1:22.180" end="1:22.360">が</span><span begin="1:22.360" end="1:22.730">少</span><span begin="1:22.730" end="1:22.950">し</span><span begin="1:22.950" end="1:23.520">羨</span><span begin="1:23.520" end="1:23.690">ま</span><span begin="1:23.690" end="1:23.900">し</span><span begin="1:23.900" end="1:24.140">か</span><span begin="1:24.140" end="1:24.530">っ</span><span begin="1:24.530" end="1:24.980">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着始终坦然做自己的你 我曾有那么一点羡慕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">看著始終坦然做自己的你 我曾有那麼一點羨慕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I was a little envious of you for staying just as you are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">있는 그대로 있어 주는 네가 조금 부러웠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t’enviais un peu toi qui savais rester toi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te envidiaba un poco porque seguías siendo tú tal como eres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf dich der einfach so bleibt wie du bist war ich ein wenig neidisch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Senti um pouco de inveja de você por continuar sendo quem é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я немного завидовала тебе ведь ты остаёшься собой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ero un po&apos; invidiosa di te che restavi così come sei</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ari no mama de ite kureru kimi ga sukoshi urayamashikatta</span></p><p begin="1:25.470" end="1:28.570" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.470" end="1:25.620">ご</span><span begin="1:25.710" end="1:25.910">め</span><span begin="1:25.910" end="1:26.100">ん</span> <span begin="1:26.100" end="1:26.290">こ</span><span begin="1:26.290" end="1:26.490">ん</span><span begin="1:26.490" end="1:26.670">な</span><span begin="1:26.670" end="1:26.890">の</span><span begin="1:26.890" end="1:27.250">傷</span><span begin="1:27.250" end="1:27.440">付</span><span begin="1:27.440" end="1:27.630">け</span><span begin="1:27.630" end="1:27.830">る</span><span begin="1:27.830" end="1:28.040">だ</span><span begin="1:28.040" end="1:28.230">け</span><span begin="1:28.230" end="1:28.420">だ</span><span begin="1:28.420" end="1:28.570">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对不起 说出这种话也只会让你受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">對不起 說出這種話也只會讓你受傷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sorry this would only hurt you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">미안해 이런 건 상처만 줄 뿐이고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pardon tout ça ne ferait que te blesser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Perdón algo así solo te haría daño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Tut mir leid so etwas würde dich nur verletzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desculpa algo assim só vai machucar você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прости такое лишь причинит тебе боль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Scusa una cosa del genere finirebbe soltanto per ferirti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Gomen konna no kizutsukeru dake da shi</span></p><p begin="1:28.640" end="1:31.380" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.640" end="1:28.800">ど</span><span begin="1:28.800" end="1:29.000">う</span><span begin="1:29.000" end="1:29.220">か</span><span begin="1:29.220" end="1:29.390">気</span><span begin="1:29.390" end="1:29.580">付</span><span begin="1:29.580" end="1:29.780">か</span><span begin="1:29.780" end="1:30.010">な</span><span begin="1:30.010" end="1:30.170">い</span><span begin="1:30.170" end="1:30.420">で</span><span begin="1:30.420" end="1:30.730">ほ</span><span begin="1:30.730" end="1:30.980">し</span><span begin="1:30.980" end="1:31.190">い</span><span begin="1:31.190" end="1:31.380">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以真希望你不要察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以真希望你不要察覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So please do not notice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부디 알아차리지 않았으면 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors j’aimerais tant que tu ne t’en aperçoives pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ojalá no te des cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bitte merk es einfach nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por favor espero que você não perceba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пожалуйста только не замечай этого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vorrei tanto che tu non te ne accorgessi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Douka kizukanaide hoshii na</span></p><p begin="1:31.730" end="1:35.220" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.730" end="1:31.850">い</span><span begin="1:31.960" end="1:32.220">つ</span><span begin="1:32.330" end="1:32.710">も</span><span begin="1:32.710" end="1:33.100">通</span><span begin="1:33.100" end="1:33.300">り</span><span begin="1:33.300" end="1:33.510">こ</span><span begin="1:33.510" end="1:33.690">ん</span><span begin="1:33.690" end="1:33.890">な</span><span begin="1:33.890" end="1:34.480">私</span><span begin="1:34.480" end="1:34.640">の</span><span begin="1:34.640" end="1:35.060">横</span><span begin="1:35.060" end="1:35.220">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像往常一样 留在这样的我身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就像往常一樣 留在這樣的我身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just like always here beside someone like me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">언제나처럼 이런 내 곁에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme toujours à côté de moi telle que je suis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como siempre al lado de alguien como yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie immer neben so jemandem wie mir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como sempre aqui ao lado de alguém como eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как всегда рядом с такой как я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come sempre accanto a una come me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsumo doori konna watashi no yoko de</span></p><p begin="1:35.480" end="1:38.370" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.480" end="1:35.990">笑</span><span begin="1:35.990" end="1:36.260">っ</span><span begin="1:36.260" end="1:36.410">て</span><span begin="1:36.410" end="1:36.590">い</span><span begin="1:36.680" end="1:36.830">て</span> <span begin="1:37.020" end="1:37.400">お</span><span begin="1:37.400" end="1:37.570">ど</span><span begin="1:37.570" end="1:37.760">け</span><span begin="1:37.760" end="1:37.940">て</span><span begin="1:37.940" end="1:38.180">い</span><span begin="1:38.180" end="1:38.370">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑着吧 继续嬉闹着吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">笑著吧 繼續嬉鬧著吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Keep smiling keep fooling around</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃고 있어 줘 장난치고 있어 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Continue de sourire continue de plaisanter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sigue sonriendo sigue bromeando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lach weiter alber weiter herum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Continue sorrindo continue brincando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Улыбайся дурачься</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continua a sorridere continua a scherzare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Waratte ite odokete ite</span></p><p begin="1:38.570" end="1:44.520" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.570" end="1:38.950">大</span><span begin="1:38.950" end="1:39.140">事</span><span begin="1:39.140" end="1:39.380">な</span><span begin="1:39.380" end="1:39.550">の</span><span begin="1:39.550" end="1:39.750">は</span><span begin="1:39.920" end="1:40.530">君</span><span begin="1:40.530" end="1:40.690">の</span><span begin="1:40.690" end="1:41.090">中</span><span begin="1:41.090" end="1:41.330">の</span><span begin="1:41.330" end="1:42.320">私</span><span begin="1:42.320" end="1:43.070">だ</span><span begin="1:43.070" end="1:43.380">か</span><span begin="1:43.380" end="1:44.520">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为重要的是 活在你心里的那个我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為重要的是 活在你心裡的那個我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because what matters is the me inside you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">중요한 건 네 안에 있는 나니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que ce qui compte c’est moi telle que j’existe en toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque lo importante es la versión de mí que existe dentro de ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wichtig ist die Version von mir in dir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque o importante é a versão de mim que existe dentro de você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что важна та я которая живёт в тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché ciò che conta è chi sono io dentro di te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Daiji na no wa kimi no naka no watashi dakara</span></p><p begin="1:45.020" end="1:50.350" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.020" end="1:45.380">揺</span><span begin="1:45.380" end="1:45.640">ら</span><span begin="1:45.640" end="1:46.180">ぐ</span><span begin="1:46.180" end="1:46.430">こ</span><span begin="1:46.430" end="1:46.930">と</span><span begin="1:46.930" end="1:47.180">の</span><span begin="1:47.180" end="1:47.530">な</span><span begin="1:47.530" end="1:47.730">い</span><span begin="1:47.730" end="1:48.510">言</span><span begin="1:48.510" end="1:48.780">葉</span><span begin="1:48.780" end="1:50.350">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不会动摇的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不會動搖的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words that never waver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흔들림 없는 말을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des mots qui ne vacillent jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Palabras que nunca vacilan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Worte die niemals ins Wanken geraten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras que nunca vacilam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слова которые никогда не поколеблются</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Parole che non vacillano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yuragu koto no nai kotoba o</span></p><p begin="1:50.970" end="1:56.120" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.970" end="1:51.810">彷徨</span><span begin="1:51.810" end="1:52.400">う</span><span begin="1:52.400" end="1:52.560">こ</span><span begin="1:52.660" end="1:53.190">と</span><span begin="1:53.190" end="1:53.420">の</span><span begin="1:53.420" end="1:53.790">な</span><span begin="1:53.790" end="1:54.000">い</span><span begin="1:54.000" end="1:54.750">言</span><span begin="1:54.750" end="1:54.980">葉</span><span begin="1:54.980" end="1:56.120">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不会迷失方向的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不會迷失方向的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words that never lose their way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">헤매지 않는 말을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des mots qui ne s’égarent jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Palabras que nunca vagan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Worte die niemals umherirren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras que nunca se perdem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слова которые никогда не собьются с пути</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Parole che non si smarriscono</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Samayou koto no nai kotoba o</span></p><p begin="1:56.500" end="1:59.760" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.500" end="1:56.860">君</span><span begin="1:56.860" end="1:57.060">は</span><span begin="1:57.060" end="1:57.360">届</span><span begin="1:57.460" end="1:57.830">け</span><span begin="1:57.830" end="1:57.960">て</span><span begin="1:58.050" end="1:58.650">く</span><span begin="1:58.650" end="1:58.980">れ</span><span begin="1:58.980" end="1:59.760">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你将它们传达给了我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是你將它們傳達給了我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You delivered them to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 전해 주었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu me les as transmis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú me las hiciste llegar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du hast sie mir überbracht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você as fez chegar até mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Именно от тебя они дошли до меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu le hai fatte arrivare fino a me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa todokete kureta</span></p><p begin="2:00.360" end="2:02.860" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.360" end="2:00.760">そ</span><span begin="2:00.760" end="2:00.960">ん</span><span begin="2:00.960" end="2:01.230">な</span><span begin="2:01.320" end="2:01.730">せ</span><span begin="2:01.730" end="2:02.050">い</span><span begin="2:02.140" end="2:02.860">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也正因如此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也正因如此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because of that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런 탓에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et à cause de ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y por eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und gerade deshalb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E por causa disso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё из-за этого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E proprio per questo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonna sei de</span></p><p begin="2:03.660" end="2:09.040" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.660" end="2:04.080">こ</span><span begin="2:04.080" end="2:04.300">の</span><span begin="2:04.300" end="2:05.100">声</span><span begin="2:05.100" end="2:05.620">は</span><span begin="2:05.620" end="2:05.870">た</span><span begin="2:05.870" end="2:06.430">だ</span><span begin="2:06.430" end="2:07.180">震</span><span begin="2:07.180" end="2:07.370">え</span><span begin="2:07.460" end="2:09.040">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的声音只是不断颤抖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的聲音只是不斷顫抖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This voice simply trembled</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 목소리는 그저 떨리고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette voix ne fait que trembler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta voz no hace más que temblar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zittert diese Stimme einfach nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta voz apenas treme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Этот голос лишь дрожит</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa voce non fa che tremare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kono koe wa tada furuete</span></p><p begin="2:09.680" end="2:14.930" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.680" end="2:10.320">掠</span><span begin="2:10.320" end="2:10.560">れ</span><span begin="2:10.560" end="2:11.120">た</span><span begin="2:11.120" end="2:11.860">想</span><span begin="2:11.860" end="2:12.120">い</span><span begin="2:12.120" end="2:12.660">を</span><span begin="2:12.660" end="2:13.480">並</span><span begin="2:13.480" end="2:13.700">べ</span><span begin="2:13.700" end="2:14.930">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那些沙哑而模糊的心意一一排列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將那些沙啞而模糊的心意一一排列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lining up these faint and hoarse feelings</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">희미해진 마음들을 늘어놓고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’aligne mes sentiments éraillés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Poniendo en fila sentimientos apagados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und reiht brüchige Gefühle aneinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Alinhando sentimentos já desvanecidos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Расставляя в ряд поблекшие чувства</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mettendo in fila sentimenti ormai rauchi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kasureta omoi o narabete</span></p><p begin="2:15.330" end="2:23.320" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.330" end="2:15.730">そ</span><span begin="2:15.730" end="2:16.550">れ</span><span begin="2:16.550" end="2:16.840">は</span><span begin="2:17.350" end="2:18.070">ま</span><span begin="2:18.070" end="2:18.850">る</span><span begin="2:18.850" end="2:19.250">で</span><span begin="2:19.250" end="2:19.900">詩</span><span begin="2:19.900" end="2:20.210">の</span><span begin="2:20.660" end="2:21.200">よ</span><span begin="2:21.200" end="2:21.470">う</span><span begin="2:21.470" end="2:21.990">で</span><span begin="2:21.990" end="2:22.280">し</span><span begin="2:22.280" end="2:23.320">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟仿佛成了一首诗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟彷彿成了一首詩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">They were almost like a poem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그건 마치 시와도 같았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’était presque comme un poème</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Era como un poema</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war beinahe wie ein Gedicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Era quase como um poema</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это было словно стихотворение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto questo sembrava proprio una poesia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore wa marude uta no you deshita</span></p><p begin="2:23.770" end="2:28.270" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.770" end="2:24.300">よ</span><span begin="2:24.300" end="2:24.590">う</span><span begin="2:24.590" end="2:25.000">で</span><span begin="2:25.120" end="2:25.310">し</span><span begin="2:25.470" end="2:28.270">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛成了一首诗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">彷彿成了一首詩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like a poem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그랬어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme un poème</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como un poema</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie ein Gedicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Parecia ser</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Словно стихотворение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sembrava proprio così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">You deshita</span></p><p begin="2:28.940" end="2:30.600" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.940" end="2:29.130">自</span><span begin="2:29.130" end="2:29.360">分</span><span begin="2:29.360" end="2:29.480">ら</span><span begin="2:29.480" end="2:29.590">し</span><span begin="2:29.590" end="2:29.710">く</span><span begin="2:29.710" end="2:29.800">な</span><span begin="2:29.800" end="2:29.910">ん</span><span begin="2:29.910" end="2:30.030">て</span><span begin="2:30.030" end="2:30.270">戯</span><span begin="2:30.270" end="2:30.520">言</span><span begin="2:30.520" end="2:30.600">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓做自己 不过是一句空话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所謂做自己 不過是一句空話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Being yourself is nothing but nonsense</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나답게 살라는 건 헛소리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Être soi-même ce ne sont que des paroles en l’air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso de ser yo misma no es más que una tontería</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So etwas wie man selbst zu sein ist bloß leeres Gerede</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Essa história de ser você mesma não passa de bobagem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Быть собой всего лишь пустые слова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Essere me stessa non è che una sciocchezza</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jibun rashiku nante zaregoto da</span></p><p begin="2:31.050" end="2:33.450" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.050" end="2:31.230">結</span><span begin="2:31.230" end="2:31.450">局</span><span begin="2:31.450" end="2:31.660">人</span><span begin="2:31.660" end="2:31.820">は</span><span begin="2:31.820" end="2:32.040">人</span><span begin="2:32.040" end="2:32.180">の</span><span begin="2:32.180" end="2:32.420">為</span><span begin="2:32.420" end="2:32.500">で</span><span begin="2:32.500" end="2:32.640">し</span><span begin="2:32.640" end="2:32.740">か</span><span begin="2:32.740" end="2:32.880">生</span><span begin="2:32.880" end="2:33.010">き</span><span begin="2:33.010" end="2:33.140">ら</span><span begin="2:33.140" end="2:33.250">れ</span><span begin="2:33.250" end="2:33.370">な</span><span begin="2:33.370" end="2:33.450">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说到底 人终究只能为了他人而活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">說到底 人終究只能為了他人而活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In the end people can only live for other people</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">결국 사람은 누군가를 위해서만 살아갈 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bout du compte on ne peut vivre que pour les autres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Al final las personas solo pueden vivir por los demás</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Ende können Menschen nur für andere Menschen leben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No fim as pessoas só conseguem viver em função de outras pessoas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В конце концов человек может жить только ради других</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alla fine le persone possono vivere soltanto per qualcun altro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kekkyoku hito wa hito no tame de shika ikirarenai</span></p><p begin="2:33.910" end="2:35.490" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.910" end="2:34.030">だ</span><span begin="2:34.030" end="2:34.160">か</span><span begin="2:34.160" end="2:34.320">ら</span><span begin="2:34.320" end="2:34.420">ず</span><span begin="2:34.420" end="2:34.540">っ</span><span begin="2:34.540" end="2:34.670">と</span><span begin="2:34.670" end="2:34.950">怖</span><span begin="2:34.950" end="2:35.050">か</span><span begin="2:35.050" end="2:35.170">っ</span><span begin="2:35.170" end="2:35.280">た</span><span begin="2:35.280" end="2:35.380">ん</span><span begin="2:35.380" end="2:35.490">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我一直都很害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以我一直都很害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That is why I was always afraid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 줄곧 무서웠던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est pour ça que j’ai toujours eu peur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por eso siempre tuve miedo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Deshalb hatte ich die ganze Zeit Angst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por isso eu sempre tive medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я всё это время боялась</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per questo ho sempre avuto paura</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara zutto kowakatta nda</span></p><p begin="2:35.910" end="2:38.170" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.910" end="2:36.320">私</span><span begin="2:36.320" end="2:36.420">で</span><span begin="2:36.420" end="2:36.520">い</span><span begin="2:36.520" end="2:36.650">る</span><span begin="2:36.650" end="2:36.780">こ</span><span begin="2:36.780" end="2:36.890">と</span><span begin="2:36.890" end="2:37.030">が</span><span begin="2:37.030" end="2:37.170">と</span><span begin="2:37.170" end="2:37.270">て</span><span begin="2:37.270" end="2:37.420">も</span><span begin="2:37.420" end="2:37.650">怖</span><span begin="2:37.650" end="2:37.770">か</span><span begin="2:37.770" end="2:37.880">っ</span><span begin="2:37.880" end="2:37.990">た</span><span begin="2:37.990" end="2:38.080">ん</span><span begin="2:38.080" end="2:38.170">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都如此害怕成为我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我一直都如此害怕成為我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I was so afraid of being me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나로 있는 것이 너무나 무서웠던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’avais tellement peur d’être moi-même</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me daba muchísimo miedo ser yo misma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich hatte solche Angst davor ich selbst zu sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu tinha tanto medo de ser eu mesma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне было так страшно оставаться собой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Avevo tanta paura di essere me stessa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi de iru koto ga totemo kowakatta nda</span></p><p begin="2:38.660" end="2:43.740" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.660" end="2:38.930">君</span><span begin="2:38.930" end="2:39.060">が</span><span begin="2:39.060" end="2:39.190">好</span><span begin="2:39.190" end="2:39.300">き</span><span begin="2:39.300" end="2:39.470">だ</span><span begin="2:39.470" end="2:39.570">と</span><span begin="2:39.570" end="2:39.650">言</span><span begin="2:39.650" end="2:39.740">っ</span><span begin="2:39.740" end="2:39.870">て</span><span begin="2:39.870" end="2:39.960">く</span><span begin="2:39.960" end="2:40.090">れ</span><span begin="2:40.090" end="2:40.210">た</span><span begin="2:40.210" end="2:40.350">こ</span><span begin="2:40.350" end="2:40.520">の</span><span begin="2:40.520" end="2:40.740">声</span><span begin="2:40.740" end="2:40.890">も</span><span begin="2:40.890" end="2:41.040">こ</span><span begin="2:41.040" end="2:41.120">の</span><span begin="2:41.120" end="2:41.420">詩</span><span begin="2:41.420" end="2:41.560">も</span><span begin="2:41.560" end="2:41.710">こ</span><span begin="2:41.710" end="2:41.840">の</span><span begin="2:41.840" end="2:42.130">夢</span><span begin="2:42.130" end="2:42.280">も</span><span begin="2:42.280" end="2:42.540">全</span><span begin="2:42.540" end="2:42.630">部</span><span begin="2:42.630" end="2:42.900">嘘</span><span begin="2:42.900" end="2:43.040">か</span><span begin="2:43.040" end="2:43.150">も</span><span begin="2:43.150" end="2:43.280">し</span><span begin="2:43.280" end="2:43.400">れ</span><span begin="2:43.400" end="2:43.520">な</span><span begin="2:43.520" end="2:43.610">い</span><span begin="2:43.610" end="2:43.740">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾说喜欢的这声音 这首诗 这场梦 说不定全都是假的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你曾說喜歡的這聲音 這首詩 這場夢 說不定全都是假的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This voice this poem this dream that you told me you loved might all be lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 좋다고 말해 준 이 목소리도 이 시도 이 꿈도 전부 거짓말일지도 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette voix ce poème ce rêve dont tu m’as dit que tu les aimais tout cela n’est peut-être qu’un mensonge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta voz este poema y este sueño que dijiste que amabas quizá sean todos mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diese Stimme dieses Gedicht dieser Traum von denen du sagtest dass du sie liebst könnten alle eine Lüge sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta voz este poema e este sonho que você disse amar talvez sejam todos mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Этот голос эти стихи эта мечта всё что по твоим словам ты любишь может оказаться ложью</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa voce questa poesia questo sogno che tu hai detto di amare potrebbero essere nient&apos;altro che bugie</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ga suki da to itte kureta kono koe mo kono uta mo kono yume mo zenbu uso ka mo shirenai yo</span></p><p begin="2:44.240" end="2:46.110" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.240" end="2:44.480">君</span><span begin="2:44.480" end="2:44.570">に</span><span begin="2:44.570" end="2:44.730">好</span><span begin="2:44.730" end="2:44.840">か</span><span begin="2:44.840" end="2:45.000">れ</span><span begin="2:45.000" end="2:45.110">た</span><span begin="2:45.110" end="2:45.220">い</span><span begin="2:45.220" end="2:45.370">だ</span><span begin="2:45.370" end="2:45.500">け</span><span begin="2:45.500" end="2:45.610">の</span><span begin="2:45.610" end="2:45.970">私</span><span begin="2:45.970" end="2:46.110">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许只是因为我想被你喜欢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也許只是因為我想被你喜歡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The me who only wanted you to like me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 네게 사랑받고 싶었던 내가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Moi qui voulais seulement que tu m’aimes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo que solo quería gustarte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich die nur wollte dass du mich magst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu que só queria que você gostasse de mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я которая лишь хочет нравиться тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Io che volevo soltanto piacerti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ni sukaretai dake no watashi ga</span></p><p begin="2:46.460" end="2:49.910" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.460" end="2:46.720">君</span><span begin="2:46.720" end="2:46.860">に</span><span begin="2:46.860" end="2:47.130">嫌</span><span begin="2:47.130" end="2:47.230">わ</span><span begin="2:47.230" end="2:47.370">れ</span><span begin="2:47.370" end="2:47.450">な</span><span begin="2:47.450" end="2:47.600">い</span><span begin="2:47.600" end="2:47.730">た</span><span begin="2:47.730" end="2:47.840">め</span><span begin="2:47.840" end="2:47.980">だ</span><span begin="2:47.980" end="2:48.110">け</span><span begin="2:48.110" end="2:48.260">に</span><span begin="2:48.260" end="2:48.360">つ</span><span begin="2:48.360" end="2:48.510">い</span><span begin="2:48.510" end="2:48.600">た</span><span begin="2:48.600" end="2:48.890">嘘</span><span begin="2:48.890" end="2:49.020">か</span><span begin="2:49.020" end="2:49.150">も</span><span begin="2:49.150" end="2:49.280">し</span><span begin="2:49.280" end="2:49.420">れ</span><span begin="2:49.420" end="2:49.500">な</span><span begin="2:49.500" end="2:49.590">い</span><span begin="2:49.590" end="2:49.700">ん</span><span begin="2:49.700" end="2:49.800">だ</span><span begin="2:49.800" end="2:49.910">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才为了不被你讨厌 编织出了这样的谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">才為了不被你討厭 編織出了這樣的謊言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">May have told those lies only so you would not hate me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 네게 미움받지 않으려고 했던 거짓말일지도 모르는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’était peut-être qu’un mensonge raconté seulement pour que tu ne me détestes pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quizá mentí solo para que no me odiaras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vielleicht habe ich diese Lügen nur erzählt damit du mich nicht hasst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Talvez tenha contado essas mentiras apenas para que você não me odiasse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Может быть всего лишь ложь придуманная мной чтобы не стать тебе ненавистной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Potrei aver detto quelle bugie soltanto per non farmi odiare da te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ni kirawarenai tame dake ni tsuita uso ka mo shirenai nda yo</span></p><p begin="2:50.420" end="2:52.400" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.420" end="2:50.580">そ</span><span begin="2:50.580" end="2:50.710">れ</span><span begin="2:50.710" end="2:50.830">で</span><span begin="2:50.830" end="2:50.980">も</span><span begin="2:50.980" end="2:51.240">君</span><span begin="2:51.240" end="2:51.320">に</span><span begin="2:51.320" end="2:51.480">好</span><span begin="2:51.480" end="2:51.610">か</span><span begin="2:51.610" end="2:51.750">れ</span><span begin="2:51.750" end="2:51.880">た</span><span begin="2:51.880" end="2:51.980">か</span><span begin="2:51.980" end="2:52.080">っ</span><span begin="2:52.080" end="2:52.200">た</span><span begin="2:52.200" end="2:52.280">ん</span><span begin="2:52.280" end="2:52.400">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 我还是想被你喜欢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 我還是想被你喜歡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even so I wanted you to like me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 네게 사랑받고 싶었던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Malgré tout je voulais que tu m’aimes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así quería gustarte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und trotzdem wollte ich dass du mich magst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim eu queria que você gostasse de mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же я хотела нравиться тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure volevo piacerti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo kimi ni sukaretakatta nda</span></p><p begin="2:52.860" end="2:54.430" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.860" end="2:53.100">離</span><span begin="2:53.100" end="2:53.230">れ</span><span begin="2:53.230" end="2:53.310">て</span><span begin="2:53.310" end="2:53.430">ほ</span><span begin="2:53.430" end="2:53.590">し</span><span begin="2:53.590" end="2:53.720">く</span><span begin="2:53.720" end="2:53.880">な</span><span begin="2:53.880" end="2:54.000">か</span><span begin="2:54.000" end="2:54.100">っ</span><span begin="2:54.100" end="2:54.230">た</span><span begin="2:54.230" end="2:54.320">ん</span><span begin="2:54.320" end="2:54.430">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是不愿你离我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還是不願你離我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I did not want you to leave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게서 떠나지 않았으면 했던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne voulais pas que tu t’éloignes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No quería que te alejaras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich wollte nicht dass du dich von mir entfernst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu não queria que você se afastasse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я не хотела видеть тебя вдали от меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non volevo che ti allontanassi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hanarete hoshikunakatta nda</span></p><p begin="2:54.880" end="2:57.200" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.880" end="2:55.000">ず</span><span begin="2:55.000" end="2:55.090">っ</span><span begin="2:55.090" end="2:55.260">と</span><span begin="2:55.350" end="2:55.450">ず</span><span begin="2:55.450" end="2:55.580">っ</span><span begin="2:55.580" end="2:55.740">と</span><span begin="2:55.740" end="2:56.040">傍</span><span begin="2:56.040" end="2:56.190">にい</span><span begin="2:56.280" end="2:56.410">て</span><span begin="2:56.410" end="2:56.500">ほ</span><span begin="2:56.500" end="2:56.650">し</span><span begin="2:56.650" end="2:56.760">か</span><span begin="2:56.760" end="2:56.900">っ</span><span begin="2:56.900" end="2:57.000">た</span><span begin="2:57.000" end="2:57.090">ん</span><span begin="2:57.090" end="2:57.200">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直 一直都想让你留在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一直 一直都想讓你留在我身邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I wanted you to stay by my side forever and ever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">계속 계속 곁에 있어 주었으면 했던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je voulais que tu restes toujours toujours près de moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quería que te quedaras siempre siempre a mi lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich wollte dass du für immer und immer bei mir bleibst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu queria que você ficasse sempre sempre ao meu lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я хотела всегда всегда видеть тебя рядом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Volevo che restassi sempre sempre accanto a me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zutto zutto soba ni ite hoshikatta nda</span></p><p begin="2:57.660" end="2:58.940" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.660" end="2:57.810">そ</span><span begin="2:57.810" end="2:57.930">れ</span><span begin="2:57.930" end="2:58.070">だ</span><span begin="2:58.070" end="2:58.200">け</span><span begin="2:58.200" end="2:58.330">は</span><span begin="2:58.330" end="2:58.460">本</span><span begin="2:58.560" end="2:58.730">当</span><span begin="2:58.730" end="2:58.840">だ</span><span begin="2:58.840" end="2:58.940">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独这件事是真的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯獨這件事是真的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That alone is true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것만은 진짜야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ça au moins c’est vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo eso es verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur das ist wahr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só isso é verdade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Только это правда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quello soltanto è vero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore dake wa hontou da yo</span></p><p begin="2:59.370" end="3:01.170" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.370" end="2:59.520">そ</span><span begin="2:59.520" end="2:59.640">れ</span><span begin="2:59.640" end="2:59.820">だ</span><span begin="2:59.820" end="2:59.960">け</span><span begin="2:59.960" end="3:00.080">が</span><span begin="3:00.080" end="3:00.310">本</span><span begin="3:00.310" end="3:00.510">当</span><span begin="3:00.510" end="3:00.610">の</span><span begin="3:00.610" end="3:00.980">私</span><span begin="3:00.980" end="3:01.080">だ</span><span begin="3:01.080" end="3:01.170">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独这一点 才是真正的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯獨這一點 才是真正的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That alone is the real me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것만이 진짜 나야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est seulement ça qui est vraiment moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo eso es quien soy de verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur das ist mein wahres Ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só isso é quem eu realmente sou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Только это настоящая я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo quello è ciò che sono davvero</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore dake ga hontou no watashi da yo</span></p><p begin="3:01.680" end="3:04.160" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.680" end="3:01.820">そ</span><span begin="3:01.820" end="3:01.970">ん</span><span begin="3:01.970" end="3:02.110">な</span><span begin="3:02.110" end="3:02.260">こ</span><span begin="3:02.260" end="3:02.410">と</span><span begin="3:02.410" end="3:02.610">君</span><span begin="3:02.610" end="3:02.750">に</span><span begin="3:02.750" end="3:02.960">言</span><span begin="3:02.960" end="3:03.070">え</span><span begin="3:03.070" end="3:03.170">る</span><span begin="3:03.170" end="3:03.320">は</span><span begin="3:03.320" end="3:03.440">ず</span><span begin="3:03.440" end="3:03.600">が</span><span begin="3:03.600" end="3:03.760">な</span><span begin="3:03.760" end="3:03.860">い</span><span begin="3:03.860" end="3:03.960">ん</span><span begin="3:03.960" end="3:04.060">だ</span><span begin="3:04.060" end="3:04.160">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这样的话 我怎么可能对你说得出口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可這樣的話 我怎麼可能對你說得出口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There is no way I could ever tell you something like that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런 걸 너에게 말할 수 있을 리가 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne pourrais jamais te dire une chose pareille</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay manera de que pueda decirte algo así</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So etwas könnte ich dir unmöglich sagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não há como eu conseguir dizer uma coisa dessas a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я ведь никак не могу сказать тебе такое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non potrei mai dirti una cosa del genere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonna koto kimi ni ieru hazu ga nai nda yo</span></p><p begin="3:04.630" end="3:07.370" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.630" end="3:04.760">だ</span><span begin="3:04.760" end="3:04.870">っ</span><span begin="3:04.870" end="3:04.950">て</span><span begin="3:04.950" end="3:04.980">、</span><span begin="3:05.000" end="3:05.140">そ</span><span begin="3:05.140" end="3:05.260">れ</span><span begin="3:05.260" end="3:05.400">は</span><span begin="3:05.660" end="3:06.090">私</span><span begin="3:06.090" end="3:06.200">の</span><span begin="3:06.200" end="3:06.360">好</span><span begin="3:06.360" end="3:06.480">き</span><span begin="3:06.480" end="3:06.600">な</span><span begin="3:06.600" end="3:06.970">私</span><span begin="3:06.970" end="3:07.110">だ</span><span begin="3:07.110" end="3:07.230">か</span><span begin="3:07.230" end="3:07.370">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那是我自己所喜欢的那个我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為那是我自己所喜歡的那個我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because that is the me I like</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">왜냐하면 그건 내가 좋아하는 나니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que c’est ce moi-là que j’aime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque esa es la versión de mí que me gusta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn das ist das Ich an mir das ich selbst mag</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque essa é a parte de mim que eu gosto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что это та я которую люблю я сама</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché quella è la versione di me che amo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Datte, sore wa watashi no suki na watashi dakara</span></p><p begin="3:07.730" end="3:10.040" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.730" end="3:08.120">私</span><span begin="3:08.120" end="3:08.300">が</span><span begin="3:08.300" end="3:08.520">大</span><span begin="3:08.520" end="3:08.800">切</span><span begin="3:08.800" end="3:08.910">に</span><span begin="3:08.910" end="3:09.060">し</span><span begin="3:09.060" end="3:09.170">た</span><span begin="3:09.170" end="3:09.250">い</span><span begin="3:09.250" end="3:09.670">私</span><span begin="3:09.670" end="3:09.820">だ</span><span begin="3:09.820" end="3:09.940">か</span><span begin="3:09.940" end="3:10.040">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也是我想要好好珍惜的那个我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也是我想要好好珍惜的那個我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because that is the me I want to treasure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 소중히 여기고 싶은 나니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que c’est ce moi-là que je veux chérir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque es la versión de mí que quiero cuidar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil es das Ich ist das ich bewahren möchte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque essa é a parte de mim que eu quero valorizar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что это та я которой я хочу дорожить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché è la versione di me che voglio custodire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ga taisetsu ni shitai watashi dakara</span></p><p begin="3:10.480" end="3:12.610" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.480" end="3:10.770">誰</span><span begin="3:10.770" end="3:10.920">が</span><span begin="3:10.920" end="3:11.040">そ</span><span begin="3:11.040" end="3:11.120">ん</span><span begin="3:11.120" end="3:11.250">な</span><span begin="3:11.250" end="3:11.390">自</span><span begin="3:11.390" end="3:11.530">分</span><span begin="3:11.530" end="3:11.650">を</span><span begin="3:11.650" end="3:11.880">愛</span><span begin="3:11.880" end="3:11.990">し</span><span begin="3:11.990" end="3:12.130">て</span><span begin="3:12.130" end="3:12.250">く</span><span begin="3:12.250" end="3:12.360">れ</span><span begin="3:12.360" end="3:12.470">る</span><span begin="3:12.470" end="3:12.580">の</span><span begin="3:12.580" end="3:12.610">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有谁会爱上这样的自己呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有誰會愛上這樣的自己呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Who would ever love a self like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누가 그런 나를 사랑해 줄까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui pourrait aimer quelqu’un comme moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Quién podría amar a alguien así?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wer würde so jemanden wie mich lieben?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quem seria capaz de amar alguém assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кто полюбит такую меня?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chi potrebbe mai amare una persona così</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dare ga sonna jibun o aishite kureru no?</span></p><p begin="3:13.020" end="3:15.480" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.020" end="3:13.310">君</span><span begin="3:13.310" end="3:13.470">は</span><span begin="3:13.470" end="3:13.630">そ</span><span begin="3:13.630" end="3:13.710">ん</span><span begin="3:13.710" end="3:13.820">な</span><span begin="3:13.820" end="3:14.240">私</span><span begin="3:14.240" end="3:14.400">で</span><span begin="3:14.400" end="3:14.510">も</span><span begin="3:14.510" end="3:14.730">愛</span><span begin="3:14.730" end="3:14.840">し</span><span begin="3:14.840" end="3:15.000">て</span><span begin="3:15.000" end="3:15.110">く</span><span begin="3:15.110" end="3:15.220">れ</span><span begin="3:15.220" end="3:15.370">た</span><span begin="3:15.370" end="3:15.450">の</span><span begin="3:15.450" end="3:15.480">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连这样的我 你也曾爱过吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就連這樣的我 你也曾愛過嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Did you love me even when I was like that?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 그런 나라도 사랑해 주었던 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce que toi tu m’as aimée même comme ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Tú llegaste a quererme incluso siendo así?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hast du selbst so jemanden wie mich geliebt?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você amou até mesmo alguém como eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неужели даже такую меня тебе удалось полюбить?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu hai amato anche una come me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa sonna watashi demo aishite kureta no?</span></p><p begin="3:15.880" end="3:17.670" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.880" end="3:16.190">怖</span><span begin="3:16.190" end="3:16.290">い</span><span begin="3:16.290" end="3:16.410">よ</span> <span begin="3:16.720" end="3:17.010">怖</span><span begin="3:17.010" end="3:17.120">か</span><span begin="3:17.120" end="3:17.220">っ</span><span begin="3:17.220" end="3:17.310">た</span><span begin="3:17.310" end="3:17.440">ん</span><span begin="3:17.440" end="3:17.560">だ</span><span begin="3:17.560" end="3:17.670">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好害怕 我一直都很害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我好害怕 我一直都很害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I am scared I was scared</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무서워 무서웠던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai peur j’avais tellement peur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tengo miedo tuve tanto miedo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich habe Angst ich hatte solche Angst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tenho medo eu estava com medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне страшно мне было страшно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho paura ne ho avuta tanta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kowai yo kowakatta nda yo</span></p><p begin="3:18.100" end="3:19.540" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.100" end="3:18.240">で</span><span begin="3:18.240" end="3:18.330">も</span><span begin="3:18.330" end="3:18.360">、</span><span begin="3:18.360" end="3:18.600">今</span><span begin="3:18.600" end="3:18.710">な</span><span begin="3:18.710" end="3:18.880">ら</span><span begin="3:18.880" end="3:19.000">き</span><span begin="3:19.000" end="3:19.100">っ</span><span begin="3:19.100" end="3:19.200">と</span><span begin="3:19.200" end="3:19.310">言</span><span begin="3:19.310" end="3:19.420">え</span><span begin="3:19.420" end="3:19.540">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是现在 我想我一定能够说出口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可是現在 我想我一定能夠說出口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But now I am sure I can say it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 지금이라면 분명 말할 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais maintenant je suis sûre de pouvoir le dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero ahora seguro que puedo decirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Aber jetzt kann ich es bestimmt sagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas agora acho que consigo dizer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но теперь я наверняка смогу сказать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma adesso sono sicura di poterlo dire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Demo, ima nara kitto ieru</span></p><p begin="3:20.010" end="3:21.880" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.010" end="3:20.250">君</span><span begin="3:20.250" end="3:20.380">に</span><span begin="3:20.380" end="3:20.600">伝</span><span begin="3:20.600" end="3:20.700">え</span><span begin="3:20.700" end="3:20.830">ら</span><span begin="3:20.830" end="3:20.950">れ</span><span begin="3:20.950" end="3:21.040">な</span><span begin="3:21.040" end="3:21.160">い</span><span begin="3:21.160" end="3:21.290">こ</span><span begin="3:21.290" end="3:21.420">と</span><span begin="3:21.420" end="3:21.530">の</span><span begin="3:21.530" end="3:21.730">方</span><span begin="3:21.730" end="3:21.880">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些无法传达给你的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些無法傳達給你的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The things I cannot tell you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너에게 전하지 못하는 것이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne pas pouvoir te le transmettre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No poder decírtelo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es dir nicht sagen zu können</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquilo que não consigo transmitir a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">То что я не могу передать это тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il fatto di non riuscire a dirtelo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi ni tsutaerarenai koto no hou ga</span></p><p begin="3:22.170" end="3:24.330" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.170" end="3:22.270">ず</span><span begin="3:22.270" end="3:22.380">っ</span><span begin="3:22.380" end="3:22.470">と</span><span begin="3:22.470" end="3:22.720">痛</span><span begin="3:22.720" end="3:22.800">い</span><span begin="3:22.800" end="3:22.890">ん</span><span begin="3:22.890" end="3:23.030">だ</span><span begin="3:23.030" end="3:23.120">と</span><span begin="3:23.120" end="3:23.270">わ</span><span begin="3:23.270" end="3:23.380">か</span><span begin="3:23.380" end="3:23.470">っ</span><span begin="3:23.470" end="3:23.590">て</span><span begin="3:23.590" end="3:23.710">し</span><span begin="3:23.710" end="3:23.810">ま</span><span begin="3:23.810" end="3:23.910">っ</span><span begin="3:23.910" end="3:24.040">た</span><span begin="3:24.040" end="3:24.190">か</span><span begin="3:24.190" end="3:24.330">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经明白 才更加令人痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我已經明白 才更加令人痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I finally realized they hurt so much more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">훨씬 더 아프다는 걸 알아 버렸으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que j’ai fini par comprendre que cela faisait bien plus mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque he comprendido que duele mucho más</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Tut viel mehr weh das habe ich nun verstanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu percebi que dói muito mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Куда больнее я это поняла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho capito che fa molto più male</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zutto itai nda to wakatte shimatta kara</span></p><p begin="3:24.690" end="3:30.090" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.690" end="3:25.120">揺</span><span begin="3:25.120" end="3:25.370">ら</span><span begin="3:25.370" end="3:25.910">ぐ</span><span begin="3:25.910" end="3:26.160">こ</span><span begin="3:26.160" end="3:26.690">と</span><span begin="3:26.690" end="3:26.920">の</span><span begin="3:26.920" end="3:27.270">な</span><span begin="3:27.270" end="3:27.450">い</span><span begin="3:27.450" end="3:28.240">言</span><span begin="3:28.240" end="3:28.480">葉</span><span begin="3:28.480" end="3:30.090">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不会动摇的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不會動搖的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words that never waver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흔들림 없는 말을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des mots qui ne vacillent jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Palabras que nunca vacilan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Worte die niemals ins Wanken geraten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras que nunca vacilam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слова которые никогда не поколеблются</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Parole che non vacillano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yuragu koto no nai kotoba o</span></p><p begin="3:30.750" end="3:35.840" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.750" end="3:31.580">彷徨</span><span begin="3:31.580" end="3:32.140">う</span><span begin="3:32.140" end="3:32.300">こ</span><span begin="3:32.390" end="3:32.910">と</span><span begin="3:32.910" end="3:33.160">の</span><span begin="3:33.160" end="3:33.480">な</span><span begin="3:33.480" end="3:33.680">い</span><span begin="3:33.680" end="3:34.490">言</span><span begin="3:34.490" end="3:34.760">葉</span><span begin="3:34.760" end="3:35.840">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不会迷失方向的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不會迷失方向的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words that never lose their way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">헤매지 않는 말을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des mots qui ne s’égarent jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Palabras que nunca vagan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Worte die niemals umherirren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras que nunca se perdem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слова которые никогда не собьются с пути</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Parole che non si smarriscono</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Samayou koto no nai kotoba o</span></p><p begin="3:36.220" end="3:39.520" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.220" end="3:36.580">君</span><span begin="3:36.580" end="3:36.790">は</span><span begin="3:36.790" end="3:37.090">届</span><span begin="3:37.180" end="3:37.580">け</span><span begin="3:37.580" end="3:37.790">て</span><span begin="3:37.790" end="3:38.390">く</span><span begin="3:38.390" end="3:38.630">れ</span><span begin="3:38.730" end="3:39.520">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你将它们传达给了我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是你將它們傳達給了我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You delivered them to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너는 전해 주었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu me les as transmis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú me las hiciste llegar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du hast sie mir überbracht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você as fez chegar até mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Именно от тебя они дошли до меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu le hai fatte arrivare fino a me</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi wa todokete kureta</span></p><p begin="3:40.110" end="3:42.580" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.110" end="3:40.520">そ</span><span begin="3:40.520" end="3:40.710">ん</span><span begin="3:40.710" end="3:40.940">な</span><span begin="3:41.040" end="3:41.460">せ</span><span begin="3:41.460" end="3:41.760">い</span><span begin="3:41.870" end="3:42.580">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也正因如此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也正因如此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because of that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런 탓에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et à cause de ça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y por eso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und gerade deshalb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E por causa disso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё из-за этого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E proprio per questo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonna sei de</span></p><p begin="3:43.210" end="3:49.530" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.210" end="3:43.620">枯</span><span begin="3:43.620" end="3:43.740">れ</span><span begin="3:43.830" end="3:44.200">て</span><span begin="3:44.810" end="3:45.190">落</span><span begin="3:45.190" end="3:45.400">ち</span><span begin="3:45.400" end="3:45.810">た</span><span begin="3:47.300" end="3:47.610">い</span><span begin="3:47.700" end="3:48.070">つ</span><span begin="3:48.070" end="3:48.510">か</span><span begin="3:48.510" end="3:48.860">の</span><span begin="3:48.860" end="3:49.530">花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那朵曾经枯萎凋落的花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那朵曾經枯萎凋落的花</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The flower from long ago that withered and fell</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">말라 떨어진 어느 날의 꽃</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette fleur d’autrefois fanée et tombée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aquella flor que un día se marchitó y cayó</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Blume von einst die verwelkte und zu Boden fiel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A flor de um dia que murchou e caiu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Цветок что когда-то увял и опал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quel fiore di un tempo ormai appassito e caduto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Karete ochita itsuka no hana</span></p><p begin="3:49.640" end="3:55.040" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.640" end="3:50.060">こ</span><span begin="3:50.060" end="3:50.280">の</span><span begin="3:50.280" end="3:51.080">声</span><span begin="3:51.080" end="3:51.620">は</span><span begin="3:51.620" end="3:51.880">ま</span><span begin="3:51.880" end="3:52.400">だ</span><span begin="3:52.400" end="3:53.170">震</span><span begin="3:53.170" end="3:53.360">え</span><span begin="3:53.470" end="3:55.040">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的声音依然还在颤抖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的聲音依然還在顫抖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This voice is still trembling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 목소리는 아직 떨리고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette voix tremble encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esta voz todavía tiembla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diese Stimme zittert noch immer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esta voz ainda treme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Этот голос всё ещё дрожит</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa voce trema ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kono koe wa mada furuete</span></p><p begin="3:55.680" end="4:00.910" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.680" end="3:56.280">掠</span><span begin="3:56.280" end="3:56.500">れ</span><span begin="3:56.500" end="3:57.060">た</span><span begin="3:57.060" end="3:57.830">想</span><span begin="3:57.830" end="3:58.080">い</span><span begin="3:58.080" end="3:58.640">も</span><span begin="3:58.640" end="3:59.420">滲</span><span begin="3:59.420" end="3:59.670">ん</span><span begin="3:59.670" end="4:00.910">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些沙哑的心意也渐渐洇开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些沙啞的心意也漸漸洇開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even these faint and hoarse feelings begin to blur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">희미해진 마음도 번져 가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même mes sentiments éraillés se brouillent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y hasta los sentimientos apagados se desdibujan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch die brüchigen Gefühle verschwimmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até os sentimentos desvanecidos se espalham</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И поблекшие чувства расплываются</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche i sentimenti ormai rauchi si fanno indistinti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kasureta omoi mo nijinde</span></p><p begin="4:01.300" end="4:09.290" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.300" end="4:01.740">そ</span><span begin="4:01.740" end="4:02.420">れ</span><span begin="4:02.520" end="4:03.330">で</span><span begin="4:03.330" end="4:03.640">も</span><span begin="4:04.060" end="4:05.070">大</span><span begin="4:05.210" end="4:05.880">切</span><span begin="4:05.880" end="4:06.190">な</span><span begin="4:06.610" end="4:07.420">声</span><span begin="4:07.420" end="4:07.790">な</span><span begin="4:07.790" end="4:07.970">ん</span><span begin="4:07.970" end="4:08.150">だ</span><span begin="4:08.270" end="4:09.290">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 这依然是我无比珍视的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 這依然是我無比珍視的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even so this is a precious voice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 소중한 목소리라는 걸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant cette voix est précieuse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así esta voz es muy preciada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und trotzdem ist diese Stimme etwas Kostbares</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim é uma voz preciosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же что этот голос по-настоящему дорог</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure che questa sia una voce preziosa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo taisetsu na koe nanda to</span></p><p begin="4:09.720" end="4:12.470" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:09.720" end="4:10.280">知</span><span begin="4:10.280" end="4:10.500">り</span><span begin="4:10.610" end="4:10.980">ま</span><span begin="4:11.100" end="4:11.330">し</span><span begin="4:11.440" end="4:12.470">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终于明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我終於明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I came to know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알게 되었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je l’ai compris</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso llegué a comprender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das habe ich erkannt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi isso que eu descobri</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я поняла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;ho capito</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shirimashita</span></p><p begin="4:12.830" end="4:17.720" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.830" end="4:13.420">知</span><span begin="4:13.420" end="4:13.600">り</span><span begin="4:13.690" end="4:14.120">ま</span><span begin="4:14.230" end="4:14.440">し</span><span begin="4:14.560" end="4:17.720">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终于明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我終於明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I came to know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알게 되었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je l’ai compris</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso llegué a comprender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das habe ich erkannt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi isso que eu descobri</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я поняла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L&apos;ho capito</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shirimashita</span></p></div></body></tt>